      "typical_award_size": "State density bonus law (Government Code 65915 to 65918) implemented in Chapter 21.03 Section 13 as amended December 13, 2022, covering concessions and incentives, fractional unit rules and rental, for-sale and condominium projects; Section 14 adds optional affordable-by-design development standards assessed case by case. The 2023-2031 Housing Element rezoning (Ordinance 1091 and Resolution 2026-5, January 13, 2026) created a Residential High zone on twelve parcels, and HCD certified the Housing Element on February 3, 2026.",
